  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />Multiplying by <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math> ,<br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0036_4ad7d361cc6d.png\" style=\"width:1.79375in;height:1.16667in\" /><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> at<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math> in <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> four times in <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> for which <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi>x</mi></math> are not defined<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is not possible<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Number of roots in <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo></math>"
